# Types

## Layout

- One file per CRM entity under `src/types/entities/`
- Shared API wrappers live in `src/types/api.ts` / `generic-entities.ts`
- Always re-export new types from `src/types/index.ts` (group by domain)

## Conventions

- Dates as ISO **strings**, never `Date`
- Define the entity interface first, then response wrappers (`SomethingResponse`, paginated wrappers)
- Backend may return an ID **or** a nested object for the same field — use union types when observed

```typescript
// src/types/entities/example.ts
export interface Example {
  id: number
  created_at: string // ISO string
}

export interface ExampleResponse {
  example: Example
}
```

```typescript
// src/types/index.ts
export type { Example, ExampleResponse } from './entities/example.js'
```

